{
  "slug": "bright-data",
  "name": "Bright Data",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "One MCP for the Web. Easily search, crawl, navigate, and extract websites without getting blocked. Ideal for discovering and retrieving structured insights from any public source - effortlessly and ethically. Covers 60+ tools across search engines, e-commerce, social media, business directories, finance, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `agent-onboarding` (Onboard an agent to Bright Data), `brand-listening` (Social listening and brand reputation research using Bright Data's web scraping infrastructure), `brd-browser-debug` (Debug Bright Data Scraping Browser sessions using the Browser Sessions API), `bright-data-best-practices` (Build production-ready Bright Data integrations with best practices baked in), `bright-data-mcp` (Bright Data MCP handles ALL web data operations), `brightdata-cli` (Guide for using the Bright Data CLI (`brightdata` / `bdata`) to scrape websites, search the web, extract structured…), `competitive-intel` (Real-time competitive intelligence and market research using Bright Data's web scraping infrastructure), `data-feeds` (Extract structured data from 40+ supported platforms (Amazon, LinkedIn, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, YouTube, Reddit, and more) via the…), and 13 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install bright-data@claude-community` from `brightdata/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
